license: MIT
keywords:
  - IELTS
  - language learning
  - captioned video
  - shadowing
  - spaced repetition
  - Firefox extension
  - Vietnamese
abstract: >-
  A free, login-free Firefox extension for bilingual English/Vietnamese IELTS
  preparation, including deterministic on-device caption-to-listening practice,
  cue-aligned listen-and-repeat shadowing drills with three replay engines,
  local writing analysis, speaking recording, and spaced vocabulary review.
